# Every image builds from the repository root (see the `context: .` lines in
# docker-compose.yml), so this file — not any per-module file — is what
# decides what enters an image. The patterns mirror .gitignore, so a file
# that is not in the repository is also not in the image.
#
# scripts/check_dockerignore.py keeps the two in step.

# ── Version control and CI ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.github

# ── Secrets / environment ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!*.env.example
# Private keys and certificates must never enter an image, even when one is
# lying in the tree uncommitted.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# ── Rust (mcp-shield, crates/pbm-secret-boundary) ───────────────────────
**/target
**/baseline_hashes.json
# The lock file serializing read-modify-write cycles on that store.
**/*.json.lock

# ── Python (vector-anchor, trace-audit, python-common) ──────────────────
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
**/.venv-next
**/venv
**/build
**/dist

# ── Node / Next.js (dashboard) ──────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/next-env.d.ts
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
**/npm-debug.log*

# ── Runtime-generated data / models ─────────────────────────────────────
**/chroma_store
**/baseline_distribution.json
# Detector state plus its .tmp / .unreadable / .unreadable.N siblings.
**/detector_state.json*
**/.ollama
**/.agent-state
**/.monolith
**/.native-pg-*

# ── Durable event outboxes (hold event payloads; never ship them) ───────
# The names are listed explicitly: a wildcard here would swallow outbox.rs.
# The extension is part of the pattern for the same reason — `**/*outbox*`
# would match the Rust source file outbox.rs.
**/outbox.jsonl
**/outbox.dead
**/outbox.lock
**/outbox.tmp
**/*outbox.jsonl
**/*outbox.dead
**/*outbox.lock
**/*outbox.tmp
**/*outbox.db*

# ── Local-only material (not part of the codebase) ──────────────────────
CLAUDE.md
docker-compose.override.yml
**/output
**/video
**/evaluation/results
**/fixtures/benchmark_results.json
*.pdf
build_aeos_*.py
build_five_project_explanations.py
_aeos_p*.png
o.json
r.json

# ── Editor / OS / patch dirties ─────────────────────────────────────────
**/.DS_Store
**/desktop.ini
**/Thumbs.db
**/ehthumbs.db
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.orig
**/*.rej
**/*~
**/*.bak

# ── Logs and temporary files ────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
